def snap_whole(c, E, R, a, sc):
    """the corridor of ZenRay Lines : along the normal of each sample, the strongest line near the curve ; the stroke moves only as a whole, when most of its length lies on a line and agrees on one offset, because a point by point snap jumps to the nearest shading (measured on the truth, 1 November 2026). Returns the moved samples or None, and the share of the stroke on a line"""
